## JIRA Structure

### Project Hierarchy
```
Project (JIRA-KEY)
├── Epic: Large Feature
│   ├── Story: User Requirement
│   │   ├── Sub-task: Technical piece
│   │   └── Sub-task: Code review
│   └── Story: Another Requirement
│       └── Sub-task: Implementation
├── Bug: Production Issue
├── Task: Administrative Work
└── Component: Logical grouping
    ├── Issues by feature
    └── Issues by module
```

### Issue Lifecycle
```
To Do → In Progress → In Review → Done
  ↓                                  ↑
  └──────── Blocked (may stay) ─────┘
```

### Workflow Transitions
- Configurable per project
- Different workflows for different issue types
- Automatic transitions possible with automation rules
- Validators and post-functions for business logic

