## Advanced Features

### Advanced Searching with JQL (JIRA Query Language)

#### Basic Syntax
```
field = value
field != value
field > value
field < value
field IN (value1, value2)
field NOT IN (value1, value2)
field ~ value (contains)
field !~ value (doesn't contain)
```

#### Common Queries

```jql
# All open bugs in current project
type = Bug AND status != Done

# Issues assigned to me
assignee = currentUser()

# High priority issues blocked
priority >= High AND status = Blocked

# Issues due this week
duedate >= startOfWeek() AND duedate <= endOfWeek()

# Issues not yet estimated
storyPoints is EMPTY

# Issues from last sprint
sprint in openSprints()

# Issues with specific label
labels = security OR labels = performance

# Issues with parent epic
parent = PROJ-100

# Custom field query
customfield_10000 > 50

# Multiple conditions
project = PROJ AND type = Story AND assignee = john 
  AND priority = High AND dueDate > -1w

# Components
component IN (Frontend, Backend)

# Affects version
affectsVersion = "1.0.0"

# Creator filter
creator = jane AND created > -30d
```

