├─ Create tech lead council for architecture decisions
└─ Weekly dependency review meeting

JIRA automation for scale:
├─ Auto-notify watchers on status change
├─ Auto-link related issues (by component)
├─ Auto-create sub-tasks for common workflows
├─ Auto-update dashboards (no manual tracking)
└─ Auto-escalate blocked issues after 3 days

Metrics to monitor:
├─ Velocity: Should stabilize at new level
