   "Before JIRA: 40% sprint goal achievement
    After JIRA: 92% sprint goal achievement
    That's why we're keeping it."

6. Address specific concerns:

   "It's extra work"
   └─ Measure: Time to standup before vs after
      Hypothesis: Less time in sync meetings,
