      Reality check: Is comment taking more time
                    than verbal update? Usually no.

   "I prefer Slack"
   └─ Agree: Slack is good for real-time chat
      Problem: Slack is ephemeral, not archival
      Solution: Chat in Slack + document in JIRA
               (Slack for discussion, JIRA for decisions)

   "We're too busy to update JIRA"
   └─ Budget: How long is comment?
      30 seconds. Over sprint = 3 minutes.
      Benefit: No standup = 30 minutes saved.
      ROI: +2970% time saved

7. Build good habits gradually

   Week 1: Create all issues (required)
   └─ Benefit: Visibility into work volume

   Week 2: Add status (required in standup)
   └─ Benefit: Progress tracking possible

   Week 3: Use JIRA links for blockers
   └─ Benefit: Dependency identification

