#### JIRA Search and Filtering (Developers)

**Useful JQL Filters**
```
# Your open issues
assignee = currentUser() AND resolution = Unresolved

# Issues waiting on you
status = "Code Review" AND reviewer = currentUser()

# Your team's work
assignee in (john, sarah, maria) AND sprint = activeSprints()

# Blockers in your project
project = PROJ AND status = Blocked

# Issues you might want to help with
assignee = Unassigned AND sprint = activeSprints()

# Recent bugs
type = Bug AND created >= -7d AND project = PROJ

# Performance issues (technical debt)
label = performance AND status != Done

# Issues with your comments
comment ~ currentUser() AND updated >= -30d

# High priority, unassigned (opportunity to grab)
priority = High AND assignee = Unassigned
  AND project = PROJ

# Issues approaching due date
duedate <= +7d AND status != Done

# Your personal dashboard
assignee = currentUser() OR comment ~ currentUser()
  OR created by currentUser()
```

